    "notes": [
      "Values are the boss itself only. Enemies around a location boss add more runes on top.",
      "The EIP pages were last updated in June 2025, before the Deep of the Night update and later patches, so values may have changed.",
      "Party size matters: the source states solo play gives +50% runes from every enemy. Game8 samples were taken at 3-player scaling and differ from EIP by up to about 10%.",
      "Evergaol bosses also offer a choice between an upgrade and a Rune of the Strong (10,000 or 20,000 runes). That bonus is NOT included in the evergaol values here.",
      "Multi-boss fights are listed as one entry with the total; the breakdown field shows the parts (runes x count) when the source gives them.",
      "Entries with runes = null are listed as unknown in the source.",
      "Two breakdowns in the source do not add up to its stated total (ruins.albinauric-archers, evergaol.beastly-brigade). The stated total is kept and breakdownSum shows what the parts add up to.",
      "Effort ratings, expeditions and dormant-power rewards are not included."
    ]
  },
